Third-party attribution for the UI craft skills in this folder
==============================================================

Moved 2026-10-12 from sawyer-skills `skills/` (global set) into this repo as
repo-local skills: better-ui (jakubkrehel/skills, adapted: explicit invocation
metadata, project design and accessibility precedence), and emil-design-eng,
mobile-native (emilkowalski/skills). animate, break-ui and review-animations
were retired 2026-10-25: no use in Claude or Codex since they were added on
2026-10-12, and DESIGN.md already limits motion. On 2026-11-23 that retirement
was reversed with Sawyer's approval (agent-issues #91, site issue #1041 item 1):
the sixteen web-relevant emilkowalski/skills are here at one pinned commit,
with the deltas listed in section 4. License texts follow.

